   $q$The writer wants to add a transition at the beginning of sentence (9). Which choice best links the evidence to the concern in sentences (7) and (8)?$q$, $q$[{"text":"For example,","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"example-for-contrast"},{"text":"As a result,","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"cause-effect-for-contrast"},{"text":"Similarly,","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"similarity-for-contrast"},{"text":"Nevertheless,","is_correct":true}]$q$::jsonb, $q$Nevertheless,$q$, $q$Sentence (9) presents evidence that cuts against the shop owners' fear, so "Nevertheless" shows that contrast. "For example" is wrong because the Bellmere study does not illustrate the owners' concern; it challenges it.$q$, 'draft', '101d4c66-b8d7-5ec3-9cc9-968e616112bd')
