   $q$Which sentence should the writer delete because it does not support the argument?$q$, $q$[{"text":"sentence (5)","is_correct":true},{"text":"sentence (3)","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"removes-key-evidence"},{"text":"sentence (8)","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"removes-concession"},{"text":"sentence (6)","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"removes-supporting-detail"}]$q$::jsonb, $q$sentence (5)$q$, $q$Sentence (5) lists general uses for laptops and does not help show why repairable models are the better purchase. Sentence (6) stays because reduced waste is a second reason supporting the claim.$q$, 'draft', '281e851b-ca46-5e9b-a469-57b06e7317bb')
