  ('a90e8654-ff71-500e-b197-7a8254cd362e', null, (select id from public.skills where slug = 'write-g10-narrative-writing'), null, 'medium',
   $q$What is the effect of the short sentence 6 after the longer sentence 5?$q$, $q$[{"text":"It slows the story so the reader can enjoy a long description of the map.","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"misreads-pacing-speed"},{"text":"It introduces a new character who will solve the problem.","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"misidentifies-content"},{"text":"It explains the scientific reason the tracker stopped working.","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"unsupported-inference"},{"text":"It creates an abrupt turn that matches the sudden loss of the signal.","is_correct":true}]$q$::jsonb, $q$It creates an abrupt turn that matches the sudden loss of the signal.$q$, $q$After ninety calm minutes, the four-word sentence stops the reader just as the dots stop. The story never explains why the tracker failed, so the scientific reason choice is unsupported.$q$, 'draft', '3f8fbc93-449a-5ba5-a6bc-c9f7b410a891')
