   $q$Why is it important that the writer introduces Kofi in sentence 4?$q$, $q$[{"text":"It shows that Kofi caused the string to break.","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"confuses-cause-effect"},{"text":"It describes the stage lights and the concert setting.","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"misidentifies-content"},{"text":"It shifts the narrative so Kofi becomes the narrator.","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"false-pov-shift"},{"text":"It raises the stakes early and prepares the reader for Kofi's reaction in the ending.","is_correct":true}]$q$::jsonb, $q$It raises the stakes early and prepares the reader for Kofi's reaction in the ending.$q$, $q$Seeing a little brother in the audience adds pressure, and his comment in sentences 17 and 18 pays off that early detail. Sentence 3, not sentence 4, describes the stage lights.$q$, 'draft', '037409a3-bb8c-5ebc-8dbe-cacefb12944c')
