   $q$Which transition best fills the blank at the beginning of sentence 6?$q$, $q$[{"text":"In return,","is_correct":true},{"text":"Otherwise,","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"condition-for-exchange"},{"text":"Before this,","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"time-for-exchange"},{"text":"For example,","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"example-for-exchange"}]$q$::jsonb, $q$In return,$q$, $q$Sentence 5 describes what the fungus gives the tree, and sentence 6 describes what the tree gives back, so "In return" shows the exchange. "For example" is wrong because the tree's sugars are not an example of the fungus gathering water and minerals.$q$, 'draft', '826efc48-60bf-59cd-8a07-6ad490e43439')
