   $q$Which sentence should the writer delete because it does not support the claim?$q$, $q$[{"text":"sentence (5)","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"removes-key-evidence"},{"text":"sentence (9)","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"removes-counterclaim"},{"text":"sentence (11)","is_correct":true},{"text":"sentence (8)","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"removes-rebuttal"}]$q$::jsonb, $q$sentence (11)$q$, $q$Sentence (11) is a general statement about soccer's popularity that does not help prove the league needs video review. Sentence (5) is the key evidence that officiating errors changed playoff results.$q$, 'draft', '175c0575-5051-5d8e-99de-5188c2c476d4')
